    "subject": "microbiology",
    "originalNumber": 23,
    "stem": "A 5 year old male was brought to the clinic by his\nmother because of 4 day history of fever, malaise and\nsore throat. Upon PE, there was noted vesicular and\nulcerative lesions on the lower lip. There was also\nnoted gingivostomatitis. Which of the following is the\ncausative agent?",
