    "subject": "microbiology",
    "originalNumber": 50,
    "stem": "A 26 year old man who recently returned from a hiking\ntrip came to the physician because of 5-day history of\nflatulence, diarrhea, foul-smelling stools and abdominal\ncramping. Fecalysis revealed heart-shaped organism\nwith flagella. Which of the following is drug of choice\nfor this disease?",
