    "subject": "microbiology",
    "originalNumber": 52,
    "stem": "HIV has 3 main structural genes. One of the protein\nproducts is reverse transcriptase which synthesizes\ndsDNA from genomic RNA; dsDNA will then integrate\ninto host genome. Reverse transcriptase is a protein\nproduct of which of the following viral genes?",
