    "stem": "An 8 year old male was brought to the clinic because of\nyellow crusts on the scalp. Upon PE, there was noted\nconcave, sulfur-yellow crusts (scutula) forming around\nloose wiry hairs. A KOH prep of the skin and hair was\ndone which revealed branching hyphae and chains of\narthroconidia. Which of the following is the most likely\ncausal organism?",
