    "originalNumber": 128,
    "stem": "A 12 year old male was brought to the physician by his\nmother because of hypopigmented patches on his chest\nand back that are slightly pruritic. Upon KOH exam of\nskin scrapings, there were short unbranched,\nnonpigmented hyphae and spherical cells observed.\nWhich of the following the most likely causal organism?",
