    "stem": "Steve just got back home from a 3-day hike. He had\nbeen experiencing abdominal pain with repeated bouts\nof loose stool and excessive foul smelling flatus. One of\nthe following is NOT TRUE regarding the causative\nagent of Steve’s condition?",
