      "B": "Clostridium perfringens is not the most likely cause of Toxic Shock Syndrome. TSS is primarily associated with Staphylococcus aureus or Streptococcus pyogenes.",
      "C": "Salmonella typhi is not a common cause of Toxic Shock Syndrome. TSS is typically associated with Staphylococcus aureus or Streptococcus pyogenes.",
      "D": "Shigella is not a common cause of Toxic Shock Syndrome. TSS is predominantly linked to Staphylococcus aureus or Streptococcus pyogenes."
