    "id": "superexam-microbiology-0125",
    "subject": "microbiology",
    "originalNumber": 125,
    "stem": "A 15-year old female male was brought to the hospital by\nher parents due to sore throat and fever. On physical\nexamination, he has pharyngeal and tonsillar exudates\nand tenderness on the cervical lymph nodes. Throat\nculture done showed gram-positive cocci in chains with\ncomplete hemolysis and is catalase negative. Which of\nthe following is true regarding the most likely cause of\nthis condition?",
