    "correctChoice": "D",
    "explanation": "Option A is incorrect. Anti-DNAse B document\nantecedent skin infection.. It is the ASO titers\nthat document antecedent pharyngitis. Option\nB is incorrect. Glomerulus in incorrect. The\nimmunologic spectrum of this orgnasim\ncauses glomerulonephritis (PSGN) is caused\nby M protein that incites immune complex\ndeposition on the glomerular basement\nmembrane. Streptococcal toxic shock\nsyndrome is caused by pyogenic exotoxin A\n(not exotoxin B).",
