    "id": "superexam-microbiology-0134",
    "subject": "microbiology",
    "originalNumber": 134,
    "stem": "Patient presented with anorexia, malaise, abdominal\npain and jaundice. Complete blood count showed\nneutropenia and mild thrombocytopenia. What is the\nbest source of culture specimen for the patient to\nconfirm the presence of Samonella?",
