    "correctChoice": "A",
    "explanation": "the most important treatment for patient with\ncholera is fluid replacement and electrolyte\ncorrection through intravenous hydration.\nAdministration of tetracycline will only\ndecrease the stool output and the duration of\nthe disease.",
