    "subject": "microbiology",
    "originalNumber": 228,
    "stem": "A 24 y/o male presented to your clinic with history of\ndysuria. Upon physical examination, there was\nexpression of pus on the penile meatus. Microscopic\nfinding shows multiple diplococci found inside\nmacrophages. Which of the following is true about his\ncondition?",
