    "stem": "A 27 year old male, diagnosed with AIDS and is currently\non HAART presented with a 2 weeks history of painless,\nprogressive blurring of vision. His latest CD4 count was\nnoted to be 35/uL. Fundoscopic findings showed areas\nof retinal necrosis, edema and hemorrhage. What is the\nmost probable causative agent in this case?",
