    "stem": "A 25 year old man suffered major injuries to his right leg\nafter a motorcycle accident. He was brough to the ER\nafter 2 days due to a high grade fever. On examination\nhe was febrile at 39.6 C and tachycardic at 128 bpm. His\nright leg is swollen and tense, with thin, dark serous fluid\ndraining from the wound. The skin is cool, pale and\nshining. Crepitus can also be felt. Which of the following\nis the most likely causative agent?",
