    "stem": "A 3 year old girl, with an unknown immunization\nhistory, presented to the emergency room due to\ndifficulty of breathing. She has a high grade fever\naccompanied by drooling and hoarseness. Auscultation\nrevealed the presence of stridor. She was immediately\nintubated and started on intravenous anitbiotics. What is\nthe most likely causative agent in this case?",
