    "originalNumber": 300,
    "stem": "A 46 year old female, who is a chronic alcoholic,\npresented with a 4 day history of cough with a\ncharacteristic thick and blood-tinged sputum, fever and\ndyspnea. Physical exam showed crackles on both right\nand left lower lung fields. Sputum GS and CS were done.\nThe gram stain showed numerous gram negative bacilli.\nCulture yielded growth of pinkish mucoid colonies in the\nMacConkey Agar. Which of the following is the likely\ncausative agent ?",
