    "stem": "A 25 year old male mountain climber who spent his\nvacation in Palawan for 2 weeks came back with high\nfever, chills, and sweating. Presumptive diagnosis is\nmalaria. If on thick smear, numerous ring forms and\ngametocytes were appreciated without other stages, one\nwould think of this Plasmodium species:",
