    "id": "superexam-microbiology-0434",
    "subject": "microbiology",
    "originalNumber": 434,
    "stem": "A broad-based budding yeast was isolated from a\nbronchoalveolar lavage sample of an elderly\nimmunocompromised patient. To prevent systemic\ndissemination of the infection, the patient should be\ntreated with:",
