    "stem": "A previously healthy 24-year-old woman comes to the\nphysician because of a low-grade fever and a\nnonproductive cough for 7 days. She has been able to\ncontinue her daily activities. Her temperature is 37.7 C\n(99.9 F). A few scattered inspiratory crackles are heard\nin the thorax. An x-ray film of the chest shows patchy\ninfiltrates in both lungs. Which of the following is the\nmost appropriate initial pharmacotherapy?",
