    "explanation": "CDC recommends that adults who might be at\nincreased risk for leptospirosis be advised to\nconsider chemoprophylaxis with doxycycline\n(200 mg orally, weekly), begun 1–2 days\nbefore and continuing through the period of\nexposure.",
