    "stem": "A 16-year old male living in a college dormitory\nsuddenly developed fever, headache, neck rigidity\nfollowed by an episode of generalized seizure. CSF\nstudies showed gram negative diplococci. Which of the\nfollowing is/are true regarding this organism?",
