    "explanation": "The causative organism is Neisseria\nmeningitidis. This irganis is gram negative,\nkidney-bean diplococci. Habitat is the URT,\ntransmission occurs via respiratory droplet,\nhence there is high carriage among people\nliving in close quarters (dormitory). Humans\nare the only natural host. Treatment of choice\nis Pen G as this organism shows no significant\nresistance to this drug.",
