    "id": "superexam-microbiology-0615",
    "subject": "microbiology",
    "originalNumber": 615,
    "stem": "A 50-year old abaca farmer in Samar consulted at the\nrural health center due to fever, cough, nocturnal\nwheezing, with pain and swelling of the groin and axillae.\nWhich of the following is/are consistent with this clinical\nfinding?",
