    "originalNumber": 685,
    "stem": "An infant was hospitalized with a severe, tender\nerythema that started on the face and then spread to the\ntrunk and extremities. The child’s epidermis was loose,\nand large areas of skin could be peeled off, leaving the\nsensitive underlying dermis exposed. The condition\ndescribed is most consistent with a clinical syndrome\nassociated with which organism?",
