    "originalNumber": 686,
    "stem": "A 40 yo man presents to the Emergency Department\nwith non-productive cough and rales on physical\nexamination. Chest-PA suggests bronchopneumonia.\nSeveral days PTA, had an onset of fever, severe frontal\nheadache and myalgia. This patient previously worked\nas a zoo janitor. If a tissue biopsy was done on this\npatient and revealed Levinthal-Cole-Lillie bodies on\nGiemsa stain, which of the following organism is the\nmost likely cause of his condition?",
